# A mailbox name holding a badly encoded modified UTF-7 sequence is a valid atom or string that names no
# mailbox: it is answered NO, and must not tear down the connection.
C: A1 CREATE &
S: A1 NO CREATE failed. Invalid mailbox name.

# An unterminated shift sequence: the trailing '-' is missing
C: A2 CREATE "&AOE"
S: A2 NO CREATE failed. Invalid mailbox name.

# Non BASE64 content within a shift sequence
C: A3 CREATE "&x-"
S: A3 NO CREATE failed. Invalid mailbox name.

# Other commands taking a mailbox name are rejected the very same way
C: A4 SELECT &
S: A4 NO SELECT failed. Invalid mailbox name.

C: A5 DELETE "&AOE"
S: A5 NO DELETE failed. Invalid mailbox name.

C: A6 STATUS & (MESSAGES)
S: A6 NO STATUS failed. Invalid mailbox name.

C: A7 RENAME & other
S: A7 NO RENAME failed. Invalid mailbox name.

C: A8 SUBSCRIBE &
S: A8 NO SUBSCRIBE failed. Invalid mailbox name.

C: A9 LIST "&" ""
S: A9 NO LIST failed. Invalid mailbox name.

# RFC 5258 3: a LIST pattern the server does not accept is silently ignored; it matches no mailbox
C: A10 LIST "" "&AOE"
S: A10 OK LIST completed.

C: A11 LSUB "" "&AOE"
S: A11 OK LSUB completed.

C: A111 LIST "" ("&AOE" "&x-")
S: A111 OK LIST completed.

# '&-' is the modified UTF-7 encoding of a single '&': a valid reference name that
# decodes to a value that is not valid modified UTF-7 itself
C: A12 LIST "&-" ""
S: \* LIST \(\\Noselect\) \"\.\" \"\"
S: A12 OK LIST completed.

# The reference is decoded once, as the pattern is
C: A121 CREATE "&-.child"
S: A121 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: A122 LIST "&-." "*"
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" \"&-\.child\"
S: A122 OK LIST completed.

C: A123 SUBSCRIBE "&-.child"
S: A123 OK SUBSCRIBE completed.

C: A124 LSUB "&-." "*"
S: \* LSUB \(\) \"\.\" \"&-\.child\"
S: A124 OK LSUB completed.

# Valid modified UTF-7 keeps being accepted: &AOE- decodes to 'a' with an acute accent
C: A13 CREATE "&AOE-"
S: A13 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: A14 LIST "" "&AOE-"
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) \"\.\" \"&AOE-\"
S: A14 OK LIST completed.

# The connection survived every single one of those errors
C: A15 CREATE anothermailbox
S: A15 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.
